window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Southern Kingdom did not bend rules or deviate from tradition. For Syrenn, this meant that she would have to continue vying for the Princes hand in marriage - even though she often found her eye wandering toward his darker, elder brother. Until the Southern Prince chooses his bride, however, she is stuck in a realm that is not her own, participating in a marriage contest against her will.</p> <p>When her fellow contenders start dying gruesome deaths, she must uncover who is behind the murders. Even if it costs her own freedom.</p>"; 
